WEBVTT

00:00.250 --> 00:02.450
Good morning, Professor Claude.

00:02.450 --> 00:05.810
How was your first week back on the job?

00:06.120 --> 00:07.880
They're good kids.

00:07.880 --> 00:10.270
All studious, gentle people.

00:10.580 --> 00:12.600
Oh, that's odd.

00:12.600 --> 00:14.490
From what I've heard...

00:14.490 --> 00:17.490
Ewe Aries sleeps through 
every single class.

00:17.490 --> 00:20.900
Leo Regulus takes over 
the podium for attention.

00:20.900 --> 00:24.140
Astrea Libra hits on female instructors.

00:20.900 --> 00:23.310
You are more beautiful than a rose.

00:24.140 --> 00:27.470
Io Torus goes around destroying 
equipment with her brute strength.

00:27.470 --> 00:29.670
Bah, so you knew.

00:29.670 --> 00:31.000
There are more.

00:31.000 --> 00:33.220
They're keeping quiet so far,

00:33.220 --> 00:36.880
but a lot of them have troubled 
households or problematic magic.

00:37.290 --> 00:40.900
Are you aware that people are 
calling your coven Pandora's Box

00:40.900 --> 00:44.170
to warn others that you aren't 
to be interacted with?

00:44.580 --> 00:46.580
That's a good one.

00:46.580 --> 00:48.310
This is no laughing matter.

00:48.560 --> 00:53.570
But the biggest problem for you 
right now is Castor Gemini.

00:54.430 --> 00:55.710
Castor...

00:56.160 --> 00:59.240
He was in the Diana middle 
school division before,

00:59.240 --> 01:02.330
where he was quick to pick fights and 
cause trouble with other students.

01:02.550 --> 01:05.820
He's a problem child who's gotten into 
serious physical altercations before.

01:06.170 --> 01:10.170
I hear that he's skipping 
just your classes.

01:10.760 --> 01:13.360
I value individual initiat—

01:12.560 --> 01:17.080
He's going to fail and be 
expelled from school.

01:17.080 --> 01:19.250
You haven't forgotten, have you?

01:19.250 --> 01:21.980
The condition for your reinstatement.

02:53.740 --> 02:54.550
What?!

02:54.550 --> 02:58.480
If even one of your students fails, 
you leave the school, too?!

02:58.480 --> 03:01.070
Those were the terms they imposed on you?!

03:01.410 --> 03:03.400
Well, you know.

03:03.400 --> 03:07.990
That's why I need to drag Castor into 
my afternoon class, no matter what.

03:07.990 --> 03:10.030
That scary guy, huh?

03:10.420 --> 03:13.260
Why is he refusing to come to my classes?

03:13.550 --> 03:15.500
Why the hell are you here?!

03:16.580 --> 03:19.880
I've noticed that he's been weirdly 
rebellious since the first time I met him.

03:19.880 --> 03:22.360
But I can't think of any 
reason he would hate me.

03:22.360 --> 03:23.710
No, there definitely is!

03:23.710 --> 03:25.670
You're crass, you're cranky...

03:25.670 --> 03:27.310
There's no reason anyone would like you.

03:27.310 --> 03:28.610
Huh? Really?

03:29.390 --> 03:30.950
I see.

03:30.950 --> 03:34.730
So I just need him to realize 
that I'm actually a nice teacher.

03:34.730 --> 03:35.810
You're "actually" nice?

03:37.000 --> 03:39.150
Spica! And Professor Claude!

03:39.150 --> 03:40.860
What are you two doing here?

03:40.860 --> 03:42.370
Io.

03:42.370 --> 03:43.510
Oh, good.

03:43.510 --> 03:45.530
Do you know where Castor is?

03:45.780 --> 03:47.540
Castor?

03:49.590 --> 03:51.270
I hear fighting over there.

03:51.270 --> 03:52.820
I think he's that way.

03:52.820 --> 03:54.530
That's how you can find him?!

03:57.740 --> 03:59.930
He's actually here!

04:02.120 --> 04:04.010
What are you staring at?

04:04.010 --> 04:06.500
He's actually super scary!

04:07.520 --> 04:09.600
Hey, are you all right?

04:10.190 --> 04:12.230
Castor! Why did you do this?

04:12.500 --> 04:16.460
He was fondling my body, 
so I got back at him. That's all.

04:16.460 --> 04:17.810
A groper?

04:19.130 --> 04:22.690
It seems like he was in the wrong, 
too, so I'll look the other way,

04:23.250 --> 04:26.740
but you're going to get expelled 
if you keep picking fights.

04:27.060 --> 04:29.190
Go ahead and expel me, then.

04:30.420 --> 04:31.830
I won't.

04:31.830 --> 04:33.860
You're my student.

04:33.860 --> 04:36.190
I'm on your side, no matter what.

04:36.740 --> 04:40.000
Would you mind coming to class today?

04:40.000 --> 04:42.090
I'll prove that it's worth your while.

04:42.090 --> 04:43.960
He's on the right track!

04:44.480 --> 04:45.620
All right.

04:45.620 --> 04:47.050
So you understand!

04:47.480 --> 04:50.060
I'll come to class if you quit.

04:51.750 --> 04:53.840
You're funny.

04:53.840 --> 04:55.890
Professor's about to snap!

04:55.890 --> 04:57.730
I have to work up the courage to...

04:58.200 --> 05:01.070
That's not right, Castor! 
You have to come to class!

05:01.910 --> 05:03.840
You're too close! Get away from me!

05:05.010 --> 05:05.950
No!

05:05.950 --> 05:07.440
You can't get expelled!

05:07.750 --> 05:09.730
I'll drag you to class if I have to!

05:09.730 --> 05:11.160
Don't touch me! You're freaking annoying!

05:11.160 --> 05:13.210
You used to be so nice!

05:13.510 --> 05:15.410
That was way in the past!

05:16.470 --> 05:18.120
I'm never going to class!

05:19.280 --> 05:23.350
Today, we'll be collecting this herb, 
which is called a mandrake.

05:23.350 --> 05:27.190
I'll have you break up into groups and 
go up the mountain to find them.

05:27.190 --> 05:29.300
I'll check on each of your groups...

05:29.740 --> 05:31.510
Thanks for coming to class.

05:31.510 --> 05:33.770
Only because you wouldn't shut up!

05:33.770 --> 05:35.510
Maybe he's easy to convince?

05:36.810 --> 05:41.600
Do not make reckless decisions 
or enter the forbidden area.

05:46.630 --> 05:49.570
Help us find the herb, Castor.

05:49.570 --> 05:50.640
Jeez.

05:50.640 --> 05:51.770
There, there.

05:54.250 --> 05:55.950
No slacking!

06:01.550 --> 06:03.810
Damn, she's a freaking brute.

06:03.810 --> 06:07.510
Castor, you were in Io's middle 
school division, right?

06:07.990 --> 06:10.150
Ack, this sucks.

06:11.390 --> 06:12.600
Use this.

06:13.770 --> 06:15.940
It'll stain if you don't.

06:16.320 --> 06:17.710
Thanks.

06:17.710 --> 06:19.430
He's got girl skills!

06:19.890 --> 06:23.490
Hey, maybe he's not that scary after all.

06:23.920 --> 06:26.570
You have cute taste, Castor.

06:27.700 --> 06:30.040
Uh, never mind.

06:30.040 --> 06:31.270
So scary!

06:31.530 --> 06:32.850
Castor.

06:32.850 --> 06:35.860
I'm so glad you came to class.

06:35.860 --> 06:37.410
How's it going?

06:37.410 --> 06:38.580
Professor.

06:38.890 --> 06:41.840
You can ask me anything.

06:41.840 --> 06:46.130
Wow, that haughty teacher's 
trying so hard to act nice.

06:47.870 --> 06:49.970
Do you know where to find the herb?

06:49.970 --> 06:52.820
Mandrakes grow mostly in moist areas—

06:52.180 --> 06:53.900
Shut up!

06:53.900 --> 06:56.630
Enough with the ass-kissing.

06:56.890 --> 06:59.670
You don't mean any of that, you creep.

07:01.150 --> 07:04.320
I only came here because 
Taurus forced me to.

07:04.920 --> 07:07.780
I'm not coming to class from tomorrow on!

07:08.160 --> 07:09.390
Oh?

07:09.390 --> 07:10.800
I don't appreciate that tone.

07:10.800 --> 07:12.870
Don't lose your temper!

07:12.870 --> 07:15.120
You have to keep playing the nice teacher!

07:15.360 --> 07:16.540
No.

07:16.540 --> 07:19.570
I need to talk to him straight, 
or he won't get it.

07:21.850 --> 07:23.910
What don't you like about me?

07:24.990 --> 07:27.050
You don't remember, huh?

07:27.050 --> 07:30.750
I guess it wasn't a big deal for you.

07:33.010 --> 07:33.920
Hold it.

07:34.370 --> 07:35.890
What are you talking about?

07:36.540 --> 07:38.030
You ran away.

07:38.030 --> 07:40.140
The day the cultists attacked!

07:40.860 --> 07:45.240
You abandoned us students 
and never came back.

07:48.540 --> 07:49.760
Well...

07:50.170 --> 07:51.680
Professor!

07:51.990 --> 07:53.950
Is that the herb?

07:58.450 --> 07:59.410
Castor!

07:59.410 --> 08:00.990
Grab on!

08:00.990 --> 08:02.770
Taurus Magic!

08:04.270 --> 08:05.970
Close one!

08:06.730 --> 08:08.300
He fell in!

08:08.850 --> 08:10.550
Huh? Why?!

08:10.550 --> 08:12.050
Grab on!

08:16.000 --> 08:16.850
Castor!

08:16.380 --> 08:17.420
Castor!

08:17.420 --> 08:19.990
Shit... She's going to...

08:28.750 --> 08:30.820
Oh, come on.

08:30.820 --> 08:33.230
I got swept so far away.

08:33.500 --> 08:35.640
And I'm soaked.

08:36.750 --> 08:37.750
There he is!

08:37.750 --> 08:39.730
Are you all right, Castor?!

08:46.350 --> 08:49.300
H-He turned into a girl!

08:50.120 --> 08:53.450
It's her... I remember her!

08:55.790 --> 09:00.460
Do Geminis have the ability 
to turn into girls?

09:02.430 --> 09:04.630
Professor, are you listening?

09:04.850 --> 09:06.840
Huh? Yeah...

09:06.840 --> 09:10.840
Ew, Professor, were you 
just staring at my body?

09:10.840 --> 09:11.820
Perv.

09:11.820 --> 09:13.150
Castor?!

09:13.540 --> 09:14.960
Relax.

09:14.960 --> 09:17.270
I wouldn't look at my students that way.

09:18.300 --> 09:20.910
You still don't know how to take a joke.

09:21.270 --> 09:26.080
Hey, your personality's totally 
changed... Are you really Castor?

09:26.080 --> 09:28.260
This is Pollux.

09:28.520 --> 09:31.140
Yup, I'm Pollux.

09:31.140 --> 09:34.340
Castor and I are twins 
sharing a single body.

09:34.870 --> 09:38.130
When I'm touched by a man, 
Castor's personality comes out.

09:38.130 --> 09:41.420
When I'm touched by a woman, 
my personality comes out.

09:41.890 --> 09:45.790
Io just touched me, 
so my personality came out.

09:46.400 --> 09:47.570
Long time.

09:47.570 --> 09:48.860
It's been a while.

09:49.210 --> 09:51.560
Are all Geminis like this?

09:51.920 --> 09:55.690
Nah, this magic is special to us.

09:55.690 --> 09:58.560
Want to see actual Gemini magic?

10:01.910 --> 10:03.410
Don't look!

10:03.660 --> 10:06.480
Gemini Magic: Mirror Augment!

10:12.940 --> 10:14.660
Ta-da.

10:14.660 --> 10:16.890
Wow, you transformed!

10:16.890 --> 10:18.090
Right?

10:18.090 --> 10:21.460
My light magic can scan and copy things.

10:21.460 --> 10:24.520
So that's a copy of my uniform?

10:24.520 --> 10:25.440
Yup.

10:25.440 --> 10:27.430
It's tight around my chest, though.

10:27.430 --> 10:29.540
Maybe I should have copied Io's uniform.

10:29.540 --> 10:30.180
Hey!

10:30.180 --> 10:33.220
I think mine are pretty big, too!

10:33.220 --> 10:34.320
Quit competing.

10:34.320 --> 10:37.220
Is it just me, or does this coven have 
a lot of people with big breasts?

10:37.220 --> 10:39.790
Dunno. I wasn't the one 
who chose you guys.

10:40.950 --> 10:44.530
Now that we know the Geminis are 
safe, we should get back to class.

10:44.930 --> 10:48.490
Pollux, I'm going to ask you 
to help with finding herbs, too.

10:48.800 --> 10:50.540
Herbs? You mean...

10:53.960 --> 10:55.410
This one?

10:56.000 --> 10:57.270
When did you...

10:58.220 --> 11:00.130
He's panicking.

11:00.520 --> 11:05.160
You looked way too calm 
for having seen me naked.

11:05.570 --> 11:08.710
I wanted to make you 
lose your poker face.

11:10.850 --> 11:13.290
My magic's pretty fun, don't you think?

11:13.290 --> 11:16.200
I can bend light and 
become invisible, too.

11:16.640 --> 11:17.990
I see.

11:17.990 --> 11:21.610
And your copy stole the jar from my robe.

11:21.610 --> 11:26.110
You made your copy the moment you took 
your clothes off and we looked away.

11:26.450 --> 11:29.830
You cast light-bending magic while 
pretending to copy the uniform.

11:29.830 --> 11:31.110
Is that right?

11:31.110 --> 11:32.370
Bingo.

11:32.370 --> 11:33.530
That's my teacher.

11:33.530 --> 11:37.880
Wow. She tricked Professor 
Claude with her magic.

11:38.190 --> 11:40.750
I completed the assignment. 
Can I go home now?

11:40.750 --> 11:42.710
Obviously not. Give that back.

11:43.070 --> 11:46.170
Try taking it from me by force, then.

11:46.450 --> 11:49.390
You know I can't do anything 
aggressive with my students.

11:49.390 --> 11:50.890
You're so nice.

11:50.890 --> 11:52.990
You care about your students, huh?

11:53.450 --> 11:54.600
But...

11:55.110 --> 11:58.010
You don't hesitate to abandon them 
when it really comes down to it.

11:58.760 --> 12:01.830
Why is someone like you still teaching?

12:03.090 --> 12:07.450
So you despise me for what 
happened that day, too.

12:08.090 --> 12:11.310
He abandoned the students? 
What's this about?

12:11.310 --> 12:13.590
Castor said the same thing.

12:13.960 --> 12:17.640
When the cultists attacked 
Diana two years ago,

12:17.640 --> 12:20.990
he ran off like a coward instead 
of protecting the students.

12:21.770 --> 12:24.460
So that rumor was true?

12:24.900 --> 12:27.410
Let's give that herb back, Pollux.

12:27.410 --> 12:29.520
I want to look for one with you.

12:29.520 --> 12:31.060
Yeah!

12:31.060 --> 12:34.220
We're in class right now. 
We can talk after.

12:34.630 --> 12:36.400
So you're on his side.

12:36.930 --> 12:40.150
Leave us alone from now on.

12:40.600 --> 12:42.440
Sorry for interrupting your lesson.

12:42.440 --> 12:43.420
Bye.

12:45.730 --> 12:46.980
She...

12:47.740 --> 12:49.620
Pollux...

12:49.910 --> 12:52.360
Professor, what exactly happened?

12:52.360 --> 12:55.570
You ran away? That can't be true, right?

12:57.300 --> 13:03.830
Two years ago, when I was teaching here, 
she was in the middle school division.

13:04.400 --> 13:07.990
She wasn't in my coven, 
but she was fond of me.

13:08.530 --> 13:10.520
She was a kind, happy girl.

13:11.420 --> 13:13.720
But on the day of the terror attack,

13:13.720 --> 13:18.210
I left them behind as they 
were pleading for help.

13:19.490 --> 13:20.930
That much is true.

13:21.310 --> 13:22.730
Why did you...

13:23.440 --> 13:25.810
I'm sorry, but I can't tell you yet.

13:26.340 --> 13:28.190
Why can't you?

13:28.190 --> 13:30.480
This is my cross to bear.

13:32.440 --> 13:35.380
I'll tell you once everything is settled.

13:37.680 --> 13:40.440
Anyway, I'm going to go find Pollux.

13:40.440 --> 13:43.340
The forbidden area is up ahead.

13:43.340 --> 13:45.980
Don't you dare leave your spot. Got it?

13:45.980 --> 13:47.790
G-Got it.

13:48.330 --> 13:51.420
I can't believe that rumor was true.

13:51.420 --> 13:52.860
No...

13:54.390 --> 13:55.490
What?

13:55.490 --> 13:56.780
I saw someone!

13:58.250 --> 14:00.440
Is it Pollux?

14:00.730 --> 14:01.850
What do we do?

14:01.850 --> 14:03.890
He said not to leave this spot.

14:05.090 --> 14:07.360
Wait... That shadow...

14:07.650 --> 14:09.680
Is it just me, or are they being hanged?

14:09.680 --> 14:10.830
No way!

14:11.950 --> 14:13.340
We have to save them!

14:14.150 --> 14:15.940
Don't do it!

14:17.450 --> 14:19.400
What is this? I can't move!

14:19.400 --> 14:20.960
Me neither!

14:22.280 --> 14:23.370
Ew!

14:23.750 --> 14:25.830
What are you two doing?

14:27.310 --> 14:29.710
We came to find you!

14:32.420 --> 14:34.190
It's a lure.

14:34.440 --> 14:35.560
A lure?

14:35.560 --> 14:37.320
A monster's trap.

14:37.320 --> 14:38.980
It uses this to attract people, and...

14:40.320 --> 14:41.950
We have to get away from here!

14:46.580 --> 14:48.600
What's up with that bug? Gross!

14:52.510 --> 14:54.010
Pollux, run!

14:54.010 --> 14:55.380
Go get the teacher!

14:55.380 --> 14:57.860
What? What about you guys, then?

14:57.860 --> 15:00.370
We'll fight until the teacher gets here.

15:01.640 --> 15:02.570
Hurry!

15:02.570 --> 15:04.000
Wow.

15:04.000 --> 15:07.290
You're surprisingly calm,
 even though you were terrified by Castor.

15:07.810 --> 15:08.500
But...

15:08.500 --> 15:09.460
Look out!

15:09.460 --> 15:11.880
Gemini Magic: Aglaea!

15:18.310 --> 15:21.110
There's no point in calling for 
that weakling of a teacher.

15:21.690 --> 15:24.020
I'll protect all of you.

15:28.050 --> 15:29.630
Thanks.

15:29.630 --> 15:31.790
You're amazing, Pollux!

15:31.790 --> 15:34.440
You're so strong. 
I can't believe you're our age.

15:35.040 --> 15:36.400
Keep the praise coming.

15:36.670 --> 15:39.130
Can Castor use the same magic?

15:39.130 --> 15:41.370
My brother sucks at magic.

15:41.600 --> 15:45.570
You know, though, that body 
switch magic is cool, too.

15:45.570 --> 15:46.580
It seems fun.

15:46.580 --> 15:48.050
Right?

15:48.050 --> 15:51.220
A lot of people think it's 
weird, but I like it.

15:51.730 --> 15:54.970
Castor and I have been 
together since we were born.

15:55.940 --> 15:58.560
Guys, where are you?

15:58.560 --> 15:59.900
Io!

15:59.900 --> 16:02.120
It's so dark. I can't see anything.

16:02.120 --> 16:04.390
It hurts. What's happening to me?

16:07.290 --> 16:08.950
Why are there so many?

16:10.390 --> 16:11.680
Damn it...

16:11.680 --> 16:13.590
They're coming from all over.

16:15.050 --> 16:17.100
Is that Pollux's magic?

16:17.100 --> 16:18.570
Is she fighting?

16:20.790 --> 16:24.030
I can't afford to use a big spell 
and get turned back into a cat.

16:24.560 --> 16:26.670
But I have to get there quickly.

16:27.130 --> 16:28.850
Virgo Magic!

16:28.850 --> 16:30.380
Gemini Magic!

16:30.380 --> 16:32.170
Taurus Magic!

16:37.920 --> 16:40.080
How many have we taken out?

16:40.080 --> 16:41.960
I stopped counting after ten.

16:41.960 --> 16:44.110
I can't believe there were so many hiding.

16:44.110 --> 16:46.720
What do we do? At this rate...

16:47.260 --> 16:48.530
Sorry...

16:48.530 --> 16:52.940
After my giant transformation magic, 
I don't have the energy to move.

16:55.500 --> 16:56.940
Don't worry, I'll—

16:59.010 --> 17:01.470
Nice try! That was my copy!

17:07.480 --> 17:10.010
I'll protect everyone!

17:10.010 --> 17:12.730
I made a promise to Castor...

17:13.650 --> 17:15.520
that I would become stronger!

17:16.080 --> 17:17.840
I can deal with it!

17:26.310 --> 17:28.850
Retreat! You're almost out of magic power!

17:28.850 --> 17:31.320
I'm busy right now! Don't talk to me!

17:31.320 --> 17:32.870
Now's not the time!

17:32.870 --> 17:34.810
You're out of your depth! Run!

17:35.150 --> 17:37.200
Are you telling me to leave them behind?

17:38.770 --> 17:40.330
I won't retreat.

17:40.330 --> 17:42.110
I'll fight with all the magic I have!

17:43.820 --> 17:46.780
Shit! Pollux is in danger!

17:50.350 --> 17:52.410
I'm out of magic.

17:58.770 --> 17:59.970
Pollux!

18:09.380 --> 18:11.490
Sorry I'm late.

18:11.920 --> 18:13.640
Why are you here, Claude?

18:13.640 --> 18:15.070
You're supposed to be a coward!

18:18.280 --> 18:20.140
I'll protect you this time.

18:20.140 --> 18:21.370
All of you.

18:23.550 --> 18:25.690
Teacher, what are these bugs?

18:25.690 --> 18:27.420
They're magic insects.

18:27.420 --> 18:30.760
They disguise themselves as trees and 
attack humans with lures and slime.

18:30.760 --> 18:32.900
They're also known as Walking Forests.

18:32.900 --> 18:35.650
I hear they occasionally attack 
villages in large numbers.

18:35.650 --> 18:37.210
They're flying this way!

18:37.210 --> 18:39.920
The screams of those other bugs 
must have gotten their attention.

18:39.920 --> 18:41.810
Wh-What do we do?

18:41.810 --> 18:43.030
Don't worry.

18:43.510 --> 18:45.520
You held up well.

18:45.520 --> 18:47.300
Leave the rest to me.

18:47.800 --> 18:50.630
I won't let a single one escape.

18:53.340 --> 18:55.560
Greater Sagittarius Magic...

18:55.560 --> 18:57.930
Anemo Bow: Rain Arrow!

19:03.060 --> 19:04.590
It's beautiful...

19:05.440 --> 19:08.090
I remember this magic.

19:09.920 --> 19:11.950
The day I entered Diana...

19:12.390 --> 19:15.410
I was enchanted the moment I saw it.

19:16.210 --> 19:18.430
By the magic of adoration.

19:20.830 --> 19:24.510
The magic I adored... Claude's magic.

19:27.260 --> 19:29.870
That was scary!

19:29.870 --> 19:32.410
I'll go make sure there are none left.

19:32.410 --> 19:34.340
Don't you dare wander off this time!

19:35.380 --> 19:37.080
I'm about to return to cat mode.

19:37.080 --> 19:38.280
You take it from here.

19:38.280 --> 19:40.230
O-Okay...

19:40.540 --> 19:42.280
But first, one last thing...

19:43.450 --> 19:49.280
Pollux, Castor, I'm sorry for 
leaving you behind that day.

19:51.350 --> 19:53.790
It's true that I left you 
in a terrifying situation.

19:54.220 --> 19:56.100
I won't make excuses for myself.

19:56.850 --> 19:59.920
So if you'll give me another chance,

20:00.500 --> 20:02.970
I'll do anything it takes to 
keep my students safe this time.

20:04.070 --> 20:05.820
I want you to bear witness to that.

20:08.940 --> 20:10.730
Okay! Bye, then!

20:13.350 --> 20:15.520
What's wrong with him?

20:16.720 --> 20:19.520
Whew. No one saw.

20:19.880 --> 20:24.490
Hey, Pollux, it seems like 
Mr. Claude had his reasons.

20:24.490 --> 20:26.970
Although he said he can't tell us yet.

20:26.970 --> 20:28.830
Why not?

20:28.830 --> 20:30.740
I don't get it, either.

20:31.380 --> 20:34.950
But he did help us today.

20:35.210 --> 20:39.630
He rushed over so fast that 
his robe was in tatters.

20:39.880 --> 20:43.590
So I think I'll try trusting him.

20:44.400 --> 20:47.210
I do appreciate him helping us this time.

20:47.860 --> 20:51.860
But I can't get over having been 
abandoned so easily that day.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.320
I don't get it, though.

20:55.320 --> 20:56.920
He's so strong.

20:56.920 --> 20:58.310
Why did he run away?

20:59.030 --> 21:04.020
I want to find out for myself 
what kind of person he really is.

21:04.640 --> 21:08.010
So I'll show up to class from now on.

21:08.470 --> 21:10.410
Tell him that.

21:10.930 --> 21:12.500
Pollux...

21:12.500 --> 21:14.390
Thank goodness.

21:14.390 --> 21:16.080
Also, what's up with the cat?

21:18.400 --> 21:19.600
Pollux...

21:20.060 --> 21:21.110
Thank you.

21:22.870 --> 21:24.230
Although...

21:24.230 --> 21:29.470
There shouldn't be magic insects around 
here, even in the forbidden area.

21:30.210 --> 21:32.340
Someone might have...

21:33.180 --> 21:34.640
Come on, man.

21:34.640 --> 21:37.310
He killed all the scouting bugs.

21:37.310 --> 21:38.560
Looks tasty.

21:39.100 --> 21:41.960
Is it true that Claude's back?

21:41.960 --> 21:43.770
Should we kill him now?

21:44.050 --> 21:45.070
No.

21:45.580 --> 21:48.500
Claude isn't our target.

21:49.100 --> 21:51.980
It's the girl who uses Rebirth Magic,

21:51.980 --> 21:53.880
Spica Virgo.

23:25.380 --> 23:28.270
Aria's always had a habit 
of getting competitive.

23:28.270 --> 23:29.950
So annoying!

23:29.950 --> 23:32.900
But I have to get stronger.

23:32.900 --> 23:34.560
Who cares what anyone says? Brush it off!

23:34.550 --> 23:39.960
NEXT EPISODE: SPICA AND ARIA

23:34.830 --> 23:37.060
Next episode: "Spica and Aria."

23:37.060 --> 23:39.480
Woof, woof, woof! Woof!
